msgid "Reset password"
msgstr "Nulstil kodeord"

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:11
msgid ""
"We’ve emailed you instructions for setting your password, if an account "
"exists with the email you entered. You should receive them shortly."
msgstr ""
"Vi har sendt dig en mail med instruktioner til at sætte dit kodeord, hvis "
"en konto findes med emailadressen du indtastede. Du bør modtage den snart."

#: templates/registration/password_reset_done.html:12
msgid ""
"If you don’t receive an email, please make sure you’ve entered the address "
"you registered with, and check your spam folder."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ikke modtager en mail skal du sikre dig, at du har tastet den korrekte "
"adresse ind, og tjekke din spammappe."
